    "## 1. Overview of Data Sources\n",
    "\n",
    "The library provides multiple data sources:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Source Type | Use Case | Latency | Cost | Data History |\n",
    "|-------------|----------|---------|------|-------------|\n",
    "| **REST API** | Historical data download | Low | Free (rate limited) | Full history |\n",
    "| **WebSocket** | Real-time streaming | Ultra-low | Free | Current only |\n",
    "| **DuckDB Repository** | Local queries | Minimal | Storage only | Your data |\n",
    "| **Parquet Files** | Batch processing | Low | Storage only | Your data |\n",
    "\n",
    "### Data Flow Architecture\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "Binance API (REST)\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "  DLT Pipeline\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "  DuckDB Database ← Repository Queries\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "  Analysis & Modeling\n",
    "\n",
    "Binance API (WebSocket)\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "  Real-Time Consumer\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "  Analyzers → Ring Buffers\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "  Live Trading / Monitoring\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
